    "reading_order": 13,
    "text": "Theorem 6.3 : If in two triangles, corresponding angles are equal, then their\ncorresponding sides are in the same ratio (or proportion) and hence the two\ntriangles are similar.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
